<title>THAILAND: BOXING-BONILYA DETHRONES THAILAND'S SAEN FOR WBA TITLE.</title>
<headline>BOXING-BONILYA DETHRONES THAILAND'S SAEN FOR WBA TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-11-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jose Bonilya of Venezuela won the World Boxing Association (WBA) flyweight crown when he beat the defending champion Saen Sor Ploenchit of Thailand with an unanimous points decision on Sunday.</p>
</text>
